{"sections":[{"slug":"Dedekindζ-函数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Dedekindζ-函数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Dedekind ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Dedekind ζ-函数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">数域</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span> Dedekind ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数为</span>\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\sum_{\\mathfrak a\\subset\\mathcal O_K}\\frac{1}{(\\# \\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak a)^s} = \\prod_{\\mathfrak p\\subset\\mathcal O_K\\,\\text{prime}}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{(\\#\\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak p)^s}\\right)^{-1}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Dedekind ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数的非平凡零点记录了</span> $\\mathcal O_K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想分布的信息</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/ζ-函数","text":"ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}